==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|дитё}} {{qualifier|non-standard, partially declinable}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*dětę}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|дитя́}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|дитя́|n-an|дитя́ти|де́ти}} (''see note on oblique forms'')

# {{lb|ru|dated|or|poetic}} [[child]], [[baby]], [[kid]] (also used ironically or in similes)

====Declension====
{{ru-decl-noun|дитя́|де́ти|
дитя́ти*|дете́й|
дитя́ти*|де́тям|
дитя́|дете́й|
дитя́тей*,дитя́тею*|детьми́|
дитя́ти*|де́тях|
note=* Archaic or poetic; see usage notes.}}

====Usage notes====
The [[oblique case]]s of singular '''''дитя''''', except for the [[accusative case]], are never used in speech or modern prose writing. Instead, the corresponding cases of {{m|ru|ребёнок}} are used, the plural form {{m|ru|де́ти}} is standard and in common use.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|ребёнок}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|де́тка}}
* {{l|ru|детёныш}}
* {{l|ru|детёнок}} (rare)
* {{l|ru|де́тский}}
* {{l|ru|детвора́}}

